[00:10.18]1. Men make gods of wood and stone,
[00:15.02]But the true God they’ve not known.
[00:19.66]He is God Almighty,
[00:23.18]As he’s often shown.
[00:28.32]Other gods just cannot see
[00:33.76]What in future days will be.
[00:38.06]For witnesses they look all in vain,
[00:42.76]Since none their godship can maintain.
[00:47.30](Chorus)
[00:47.32]We’re Jehovah’s Witnesses.
[00:51.48]We speak out in fearlessness.
[00:56.44]Ours is the God of true prophecy;
[01:00.46]What he foretells comes to be.
[01:12.82]2. Proudly we declare God’s name,
[01:16.58]Bearing witness to his fame.
[01:22.12]News about his Kingdom,
[01:26.48]Boldly we proclaim.
[01:30.60]We help others come to see
[01:35.38]How the truth can set them free.
[01:40.38]As they grow strong, their voices they’ll raise,
[01:44.38]Singing to God this song of praise.
[01:49.64](Chorus)
[01:50.06]We’re Jehovah’s Witnesses.
[01:53.94]We speak out in fearlessness.
[01:58.32]Ours is the God of true prophecy;
[02:03.02]What he foretells comes to be.
[02:07.58]3. Witnessing exalts God’s name,
[02:12.02]Lifts therefrom reproach and shame.
[02:16.68]And it warns the wicked,
[02:21.32]Who God’s name defame.
[02:27.14]Pardon it holds out to men,
[02:31.34]If they turn to God again.
[02:35.62]Whole-souled devotion brings joy and peace;
[02:39.90]Promise of life that will not cease.
[02:44.48](Chorus)
[02:44.74]We’re Jehovah’s Witnesses.
[02:49.44]We speak out in fearlessness.
[02:54.26]Ours is the God of true prophecy;
[02:58.48]What he foretells comes to be.
